\n                            <td>7.5％</td>\n                            <td>50.0％</td>\n                            <td>30.0％</td>\n                            <td>10.0％</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>2.5％</td>\n                            <td>7.5％</td>\n                            <td>50.0％</td>\n                            <td>50.0％</td>\n                            <td>20.0％</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>2.5％</td>\n                            <td>7.5％</td>\n                            <td>50.0％</td>\n                            <td>20.0％</td>\n                            <td>20.0％</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination3\">AT直撃</h3>\n                <p>通常時のレア役を契機にAT「覚醒」の直撃抽選が行われており、その当選率には非常に大きな設定差が設けられています。</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th>直撃確率</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>1/21845.3</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>1/10922.7</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>1/5461.3</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>1/3276.8</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1/2048.0</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination4\">一騎駆けの武将</h3>\n                <p>天下バトル中の一騎駆けでは、出陣してくる武将の種類によって設定示唆が行われます。</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>武将</th>\n                            <th>高設定期待度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/shintenkahubu__16.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                <p>信長</p>\n                            </td>\n                            <td>低</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/shintenkahubu__17.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                <p>秀吉</p>\n                            </td>\n                            <td>↓</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/shintenkahubu__18.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                <p>家康</p>\n                            </td>\n                            <td>高</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>出陣武将振り分け</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th>信長</th>\n                            <th>秀吉</th>\n                            <th>家康</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                 